The four files in source/src/components/ui/ (badge.tsx, button.tsx,
card.tsx, tabs.tsx) were adapted by quirq-ai/website from shadcn/ui
(https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui). button.tsx names its source, the
new-york-v4 registry at shadcn-ui/ui@6efecd8; the other three record no
source commit. They are rewrites, restyled with the website's tokens:
card.tsx and tabs.tsx use forwardRef, and badge.tsx and button.tsx are
plain functions with a class map instead of class-variance-authority.
This notice was added by quirq-ai/ui, not copied from the website, and the
files are used under the licence below.

